{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T16:53:40+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T16:53:40+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Heidelberg Materials AG","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","country":"Germany","city":"Heidelberg","website":"https://www.heidelbergmaterials.de","employees":50603,"summary":"Heidelberg Materials AG, together with its subsidiaries, produces and distributes cement, aggregates, ready-mixed concrete, and asphalt worldwide. The company provides cement products; natural stone aggregates, including sand and gravel; crushed aggregates comprising stone chippings and crushed stones; and ready-mixed concrete for use in the construction of tunnels or bridges, office buildings, or schools, as well as to produce precast concrete parts, such as stairs, ceiling elements, or structural components. It also offers asphalt; and trades in cement, clinker, secondary cementitious materials, solid, alternative fuels, other building materials, and additives. The company was formerly known as HeidelbergCement AG and changed its name to Heidelberg Materials AG in May 2023. Heidelberg Materials AG was founded in 1873 and is headquartered in Heidelberg, Germany.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Heidelberg Materials AG, avec ses filiales, produit et distribue du ciment, des granulats, du béton prêt à l'emploi et de l'asphalte dans le monde entier. La société fournit des produits en ciment; agrégats de pierre naturelle, y compris le sable et le gravier; agrégats concassés comprenant des écaillages de pierre et des pierres concassées; et béton prêt à l'emploi pour la construction de tunnels ou de ponts, d'immeubles de bureaux ou d'écoles, ainsi que pour produire des pièces en béton préfabriqué, telles que des escaliers, des éléments de plafond ou des composants structurels. Il propose également de l'asph